                                                "sense_id": "5a9a5b51-4091-32ad-af40-3e9501a2c5dd",
                                                "text": "我是一個艾滋病感染者。"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bef2e2a5-6c1a-4e82-b50e-1fd37f3959fc",
                                                "sense_id": "5a9a5b51-4091-32ad-af40-3e9501a2c5dd",
